OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon, dies
OL,4,Aafter brief battle with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FLegendary country music singer Dolly
OL,7,FParton has died at the age of 80
OL,9,F"Dolly Parton's legacy is one of love,
OL,10,Fcompassion, and resilience," her team
OL,11,Fsays - read their statement in full
OL,13,FRepresentatives later revealed that
OL,14,FParton had died after "bravely facing a
OL,15,Fbrief battle with cancer"
OL,17,FThe country icon sold more than 100
OL,18,Fmillion records worldwide, and wrote
OL,19,Fover 3,000 songs in a career that
OL,20,Fspanned six decades
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
