OL,3,ADolly Parton, country music icon, dies
OL,4,Aafter brief battle with cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FParton also devoted decades of her life
OL,7,Fto charitable causes, particularly
OL,8,Fchild literacy and education
OL,10,FSir Paul McCartney says it's "hard to
OL,11,Fimagine" a world without Dolly, Oprah
OL,12,Fsays "we are all better because she was
OL,13,Fhere", and Sir Elton John says Parton
OL,14,Fwas "unique and irreplaceable"
OL,16,FRaised in poverty in a one-room cabin
OL,17,Fin the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee,
OL,18,FParton was the fourth youngest of 12
OL,19,Fchildren - her early life in pictures
